    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4519" root="ثفى" body-key="v">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُثْفِيَّةٌ</span></b>  (S, M, K, &amp;c.) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِثْفِيَّةٌ</span> (Fr, A 'Obeyd,
K) The <i>stone</i> [<i>which is one of the three</i>] <i>whereon
the cooking-pot is placed:</i> (M, * K:) it is <i>a stone
like the head of a man:</i> (T, TA:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَثَافِىُّ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَثَافٍ</span>. (S, K, &amp;c.) [See more in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اثف</span>.]

